"""Approximate the component's ROUND-centered lexical signal.

Round/around give large negatives; related word pieces, formatting words,
and several translations give smaller ones. This is not a general circle
recognizer. The preceding word weakens topical about and orbital around,
strengthens walking around, and distinguishes split ground/surround from
round. Also recognize round of. Reset word memory between documents and
predict zero for unrecognized tokens.
