"""Negative detector for the word 'country' and for words about nations and places.

What the component does: it carries a strong negative signal when the model reads
the word "country" (about -7.5), a weaker one on "countries" and on foreign words
for countries (about -4), and a mild one on words for places, peoples and languages
(nation, national, county, city, language, currency, ...) and on Chinese characters
for country/nation/city (about -1.2 to -1.7). It also fires on the " of" right after
"country" (as in "country of citizenship", about -3.8), and weakly on " of" after
city/language/town. Everything else is about 0, with small noise that is not modelled.

The main program is `step` below: it looks only at the newest token.
"""
READS = ()

